## Project facts a fresh chat cannot infer

- Most logic lives in `vfd2_env_backend_compiled.pyc`. `vfd2_env_backend.py` is a shim that
  monkey-patches it through `_apply_overrides(ns)`, so functions may exist only as bytecode.
- Each run writes its own `logs\vfd2_env_<session>.log`, and one GUI session can contain
  several deploys with different outcomes. Always give the session ID.
- Behaviour knobs that need no code change: `ENVPILOT_ABORT_ON_PARAM_MISMATCH`,
  `ENVPILOT_VERIFY_DROPDOWN_READBACK`, `ENVPILOT_SKIP_CORRECT_DROPDOWN`,
  `ENVPILOT_DIRECT_DROPDOWN`, `ENVPILOT_MAX_ZOOM_OUT`, `ENVPILOT_MAX_ZOOM_IN`,
  `ENVPILOT_MFA_APPEAR_WAIT`, `ENVPILOT_EMPTY_APPS_WAIT`, `ENVPILOT_REMOTE_MAXIMIZE`,
  `ENVPILOT_DPI_AWARE`, `ENVPILOT_SETTLE_SCROLL`, `ENVPILOT_NEW_WINDOW_FOCUS_ATTEMPTS`.

Use **Step 1: read logs and explain**, then **Step 2: fix after I confirm** for risky changes.
